<title>USA: HMN Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>HMN Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING VALLEY, Minn 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>HMN Financial Inc said it planned to buy back up to 10 percent or 467,334 shares of its outstanding stock in the open market during the next 12 months.</p>
<p>HMN said the repurchased shares would become treasury shares, used for &quot;general corporate purposes.&quot;</p>
<p>It said it would buy the shares at the market price.</p>
</text>
